      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first proposal. The explanatory recast sems gtso bor gyur par is retained at d3; its mind is the occurrence in “Here the point is,” not the preceding supplied repetition in “mind-only.” Other repeated words are resolved in explicit English order. Distributed predication, emphases, conditional/concessive framing and the final denial of a denial are omitted rather than falsely nulled. GMR’s added explanatory repetitions remain unwrapped. The following Reading Six heading, beginning “93 The Asian Classics Institute,” is original apparatus under the registered following-heading class, not a newly filed erratum."
